      "value": 435,
      "unit": "eV"
     },
     {
      "part": "(b) the energy from n = 3 to n = 1",
      "value": 435,
      "unit": "eV"
     }
    ],
    "solution": "（a）$E = -\\frac{z^{2}}{n^{2}}$\n\n$E_{3} - E_{2} = -\\left(\\frac{6^{2}}{3^{2}} - \\frac{6^{2}}{2^{2}}\\right)13.6\\;\\text{eV} = 68.0\\;\\text{eV}$\n\n$E_{3} - E_{2} = -\\left(\\frac{6^{2}}{2^{2}} - \\frac{6^{2}}{1^{2}}\\right)13.6\\;\\text{eV} = 367\\;\\text{eV}$<sup class=\"fn\" data-note=\"c-p13-labels\"></sup>\n\n$E = 435\\;\\text{eV}$\n\n（b）$E_{3} - E_{2} = -\\left(\\frac{6^{2}}{3^{2}} - \\frac{6^{2}}{1^{2}}\\right)13.6\\;\\text{eV} = 435\\;\\text{eV}$\n\n（c）是。"
   }
  }
 ],
