      {
       "text": "原子核是一个点电荷 $Z\\kqe$，它在轨道处的电势为 $\\kV = kZ\\kqe/\\krn$。",
       "src": "19.3"
      }
     ],
     "then": {
      "tex": "\\mk{E}{\\kEn} = \\mk{K}{\\kKE} + \\mk{P}{\\kPEtot}",
