       "tex": "\\frac{h\\kf}{h\\kc} = \\frac{\\kf}{\\kc} = \\mk{h}{\\frac{1}{\\klam}} = \\mk{E}{\\frac{(13.6\\;\\text{eV})}{h\\kc}\\left(\\frac{1}{n_{\\text{f}}^{2}} - \\frac{1}{n_{\\text{i}}^{2}}\\right)}",
